#. module: quality_control_oca
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:quality_control_oca.field_qc_trigger_line__timing
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:quality_control_oca.field_qc_trigger_product_category_line__timing
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:quality_control_oca.field_qc_trigger_product_line__timing
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:quality_control_oca.field_qc_trigger_product_template_line__timing
msgid ""
"* Before: An executable inspection is generated before the record related "
"to the trigger is completed (e.g. when picking is confirmed).\n* After: An "
"executable inspection is generated when the record related to the trigger "
"is completed (e.g. when picking is done).\n* Plan Ahead: A non-executable "
"inspection is generated before the record related to the trigger is "
"completed (e.g. when picking is confirmed), and the inspection becomes "
"executable when the record related to the trigger is completed (e.g. when "
"picking is done)."
msgstr ""
"* 之前：在触发规则关联的记录完成之前（例如拣货确认时）生成可执行的检查记录。\n* "
"之后：在触发规则关联的记录完成时（例如拣货完成时）生成可执行的检查记录。\n* "
"提前计划：在触发规则关联的记录完成之前（例如拣货确认时）生成不可执行的检查记录，待该记录完成后（例如拣货完成时）检查记录变为可执行。"

